  "details": "This has been an issue for content creators for a very long time, where their camera goes inside a wall and 'accidents' can happen. Even worse, if the Occlusion itself has culling problems in the world. Please give us an option to toggle Occlusion Culling on Cameras, so these problems can be preventable. As a world creator, I've had to make tough decisions to bake Occlusion Culling or not.",
